  "notes": [
    "The model and the view follow annotation.viewport.elevation: object variable 1007 value 3 is the Front view and 1003 is the scale.",
    "GAPS.tsv names object variable 1001 as the render mode. vs.py gives no render mode codes. 5 and 6 are taken as Hidden Line and Dashed Hidden Line. The source census of the viewport records the stored mode. Revision 2 keeps the viewport whose mode is Hidden Line.",
    "In the read run of 2026-10-19, vs.GetObjectVariableInt 1001 returned 5 and 6 after reopen. The read names no mode, so the two viewports stay."
  ]
